---
title: Enchilada
---

== Enchilada Sauce ==

Make enchilada sauce by mixing @pasta sauce{1%can} (traditional), @red pepper flakes{1/2%tsp}, @sugar{1/2%tsp}, @garlic paste{1/4%tsp}, and @taco seasoning{1/2%tsp} in a #bowl.

== Enchilada ==

Prepare guacamole, black beans, and grilled vegetables as described in @./fajitas{}.

Spread a bit of @olive oil{4%tbsp} in a #pan and lightly warm @wheat tortilla{}.

Place a tortilla on a #microwavable plate{}; spread black beans and grilled vegetables on it.

Roll the tortilla, pour enchilada sauce and sprinkle @mexican cheese{} on it before microwaving in a #microwave for about ~{1%minute}.

Garnish the tortilla with guacamole, shredded @lettuce{1%cup}, sliced @mushroom{}, @sour cream{}, @salsa{}, and @jalapeno{}.
